  "mechanisms": [
    "Semantic floor, quotient and remainder variables remain internal but retain their integer/real domains during routing; generated floor triples require mixed arithmetic.",
    "NIRA normalizes literal polarity, explains singleton-bound substitutions with all active premises, and sends conditional linear residuals to the existing LIRA engine.",
    "Delegated or integer-instantiated real residuals solve polynomial and linear constraints jointly and preserve the actual witness. Unfixed coupled integers leave the obligation open; no per-constraint SAT shortcut.",
    "A shared immutable-DAG operator index skips preprocessing passes whose required syntax is absent from current assertion roots, including syntax introduced by earlier passes.",
    "Generic Boolean refutation checks clauses from the last allowed theory conflict without allocating another theory assignment."
  ],
